                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a1abe5b4-0c6d-3857-814f-8c0722039429",
                        "entry_id": "463cc366-8c55-390a-a2ab-65682e4630ea",
                        "glosses": [
                            "lemming"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2c6fa97-29ce-4ba0-b93e-84d61c7a92c7",
                                "sense_id": "a1abe5b4-0c6d-3857-814f-8c0722039429",
                                "text": "Так, говоря́т, в ста́ром Петербу́рге со Щу́кина двора́ одна́жды дви́нулись кры́сы. […] Пересекли́ не́сколько у́лиц, дошли́ до Невы́ и как в зе́млю ка́нули. Бы́ло тако́е же и с альпи́йскими пестру́шками.",
                                "translation": "Once in old Petersburg, they say, the rats started leaving the Shchukin palace. […] They crossed several streets, reached the Neva and then seemed to vanish into the ground. The same thing happens to lemmings in the Alps.",
                                "english": "Once in old Petersburg, they say, the rats started leaving the Shchukin palace. […] They crossed several streets, reached the Neva and then seemed to vanish into the ground. The same thing happens to lemmings in the Alps."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
